    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ho un’idea fantastica per una nuova attività\ncommerciale. Eh eh... Vedrai!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0002>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Eh eh... Lo sapevi che da qui si può entrare\nnell’acquedotto?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450068002000650068002E002E002E0020004C006F00200073006100700065007600690020006300680065002000640061002000710075006900200073006900200070007500F200200065006E00740072006100720065000A006E0065006C006C2019006100630071007500650064006F00740074006F003F001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ho pensato di mettere su un’attività\ncommerciale proprio là dentro.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006F002000700065006E007300610074006F0020006400690020006D00650074007400650072006500200073007500200075006E2019006100740074006900760069007400E0000A0063006F006D006D00650072006300690061006C0065002000700072006F007000720069006F0020006C00E0002000640065006E00740072006F002E001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un business assieme al mio Camerupt!\nRoba calda, non so se mi spiego!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E00200062007500730069006E006500730073002000610073007300690065006D006500200061006C0020006D0069006F002000430061006D006500720075007000740021000A0052006F00620061002000630061006C00640061002C0020006E006F006E00200073006F0020007300650020006D0069002000730070006900650067006F0021001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Rupt!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005200750070007400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ho bisogno di una mano, però.\nSe ci stai, ti saprò ricompensare.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006F0020006200690073006F0067006E006F00200064006900200075006E00610020006D0061006E006F002C002000700065007200F2002E000A0053006500200063006900200073007400610069002C0020007400690020007300610070007200F20020007200690063006F006D00700065006E0073006100720065002E001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lascio il cancello aperto.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nTi aspetto dentro. Raggiungimi, se sei pront<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa\na tutto!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Eh eh... Ti stavo aspettando.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450068002000650068002E002E002E00200054006900200073007400610076006F00200061007300700065007400740061006E0064006F002E001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Che ne pensi di questa stanza? Umida al punto\ngiusto!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006800650020006E0065002000700065006E0073006900200064006900200071007500650073007400610020007300740061006E007A0061003F00200055006D00690064006100200061006C002000700075006E0074006F000A00670069007500730074006F0021001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ti avevo detto di raggiungermi se eri pront<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa a\ntutto, no? Quindi non stupirti se ti sfido a lottare.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 111
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Io e il mio Camerupt ci aspettiamo una lotta\ninfuocata!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006F0020006500200069006C0020006D0069006F002000430061006D00650072007500700074002000630069002000610073007000650074007400690061006D006F00200075006E00610020006C006F007400740061000A0069006E00660075006F00630061007400610021001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Fammi sapere quando sei pront<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00460061006D006D006900200073006100700065007200650020007100750061006E0064006F0020007300650069002000700072006F006E007400100003110000FF0101006F0061002E001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ti va di scaldare l’ambiente lottando con me\ne il mio Camerupt?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400690020007600610020006400690020007300630061006C00640061007200650020006C20190061006D006200690065006E007400650020006C006F007400740061006E0064006F00200063006F006E0020006D0065000A006500200069006C0020006D0069006F002000430061006D00650072007500700074003F001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Certo!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006500720074006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Non mi va",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F006E0020006D00690020007600610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ehi! Questa risposta è peggio di una doccia\nfredda!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006800690021002000510075006500730074006100200072006900730070006F007300740061002000E8002000700065006700670069006F00200064006900200075006E006100200064006F0063006300690061000A0066007200650064006400610021001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mi compiaccio della tua risposta calorosa!\nMi aspetto una lotta incandescente, eh!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
