      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00550068003F002000440065006900200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002000730065006C007600610074006900630069002E002E002E001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pat pat!",
